<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">- Saafi-Saafi</book>
  <para style="h">1 Timoote</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Ti</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Timoote</para>
  <para style="toc1">Fiisi Pool koc kaɓɗoh Timoote</para>
  <para style="mt">Fiisi Pool koc kaɓɗoh Timoote</para>
  <para style="is">Rangsohaani</para>
  <para style="ip">Pool ɓaahee ŋ Israayel ci, ŋ cuuɓiŋ Benyaamin.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:1">Ɓi Rom 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Ɓi Filippi 3:5</ref></char></note> A nikee <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char>.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Tum ci 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Ɓi Filippi 3:5</ref></char></note> Ŋ finho <char style="w">Paantakot</char>, wi Janguuni camb ɓaatuk, a ɓaahee ŋ ɓi tolfiɗee kosiɗ ci.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:58-8:3">Tum ci 7:58–8:3</ref></char></note> Waaye wa raakka mbeh, a cohha na Yeesu, a kossa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:1-30">Tum ci 9:1-30</ref></char></note> po a nikka <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> sah. Teerndiŋ "Tum ciŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci" teeɓohiɗ pangkiŋ ɗe wi a nik <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ini kooɗoh ŋ saar 13.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wa miniɗ nik ne Pool hotiɗ Timoote ŋ ɗooƴ ɓaaɓaŋ ɗe yakka koc, wa a nik ŋ Listar na Derbe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:6-7">Tum ci 14:6-7</ref></char></note> Tiikiŋ Timoote, wa koc woyu ŋ ɗooƴ ɓaaɓaŋ Pool yakka kanakɗoh.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:1-5">Tum ci 16:1-5</ref></char></note> Weem raak ɗe kosiɗ te a nikee ŋ ndaam.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ini kooɗoh ndeem, Timoote ɓaahee ŋ ɓi hunee na Pool. Timoote meeɗeen ɓaaɓ in laayiɗ findi wi a wikee fiis ci Pool kaɓɗohee wala cum ɗah a nikiɗ Pool ŋ ɗisik.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:1-5">Tum ci 16:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:4-16">17:4-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 18:5">18:5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:22">19:22</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 20:4">20:4</ref></char></note> Pool seede'iɗ Timoote seede moɗiɗ ŋ fiisi a kaɓɗoh ɓi Filippi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:19-22">Ɓi Filippi 2:19-22</ref></char></note> Marka tiikiŋ Timoote ŋ Limiŋ tiik ci.</para>
  <para style="ip">"Fiisi Pool koc kaɓɗoh Timoote" wa fiisu ŋ finho "Tum ciŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci", mbaa raakiɗ in laayiɗ ci ɓo' inahɗi nga, waaye ɓoo inhiɗ ne wa raak Pool nikisɗi ŋ kaso te Timoote nikee ŋ Efes,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 1:3">1 Timoote 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 3:14">3:14</ref></char></note> kon wa fiisu ŋ finho "Fiisi Pool kaɓɗoh ɓi Efes".</para>
  <para style="iot">- Fiisi Pool koc kaɓɗoh Timoote kaɗtiɗoh an :</para>
  <para style="io1">- Kañɗohi <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Wortuk ɓi na jangɗohe in ci raakaaɗiici <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 1:3-11">1:3-11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Pool corkiɗiɗ Kooh ŋ baahohi a baahoh ɗe <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 1:12-17">1:12-17</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Nakoh ci kaɗ ŋ findi Janguuni joy tiindɗohu <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 1:18-3:15">1:18–3:15</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Yakiɗ <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 3:16">3:16</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Wortuk jangɗoh baahaaɗi, fu nik jangɗohoh baahiɗ <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 4">4</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Nakoh ci kaɗ ŋ findi ɓooɓiŋ Janguuni joy adgohohu <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 5:1-6:2">5:1–6:2</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Findi woo ciŋ jangɗohoh ciŋ in ci raakaaɗiici joy hiñohohu <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 6:3-16">6:3-16</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Nakoh ci kaɗ ŋ findi heɗ raak-raak ci joy tumoh <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 6:17-19">6:17-19</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Dengkoh ci mirndoh <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 6:20-21">6:20-21</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="s">Kañɗohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1-2" />Mi yii kañiɗ ɗa, Timoote, mi yi Pool, <char style="tl"><char style="w" lemma="apootar">Apootariŋ</char></char> <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> Yeesu. Ŋ tumuuɗ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ŋ nakohiŋ Kooh, Mucɗohiŋ ɓoo, na nakohiŋ Kiristaani Yeesu yi ɓoo oolkoh. Mi yii fiis kaytii ne ŋ woo na ɗa Timoote, kuɓki ŋ amb findi kuɓuuso keeh-keeh ngaŋ kos. Kooh yi Baabi baahohaat ɗa, a yirmaat ɗa, a on ɗa jam ; Kiristaani Yeesu Heɗ ɓoo baahohaat ɗa, a yirmaat ɗa, a on ɗa jam.<verse eid="1TI 1:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wortuk ɓi na jangɗohe in ci raakaaɗiici</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />Tuma findi ŋ woyohee ɗa wa, wa ŋ kaɗee kur caŋ Maseduwaan. Tasa ŋ Efes, fu woo ɓi na jangɗohe in ci nikɗi keeh, ɓa faɗ jangɗoheem. <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" />Woyaa ɓa, ɓa faɗ andiin ci ɓa na andiine ɓooɓi, na limiŋ tiik ciŋ caac ci minaaɗi reehi. In ceem na ɓeke taastiɗoh rek. Ca ɓaatɗohɗi ali ɓo' ŋ findi Kooh waaɗoh ne in ci tiindoh ɗaa ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ kos.<verse eid="1TI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />Ini tah ŋ woosa ineem, weɗ ne ŋ waaɗ ne ɓooɓi waaɗtiɗoh na keeñ moɗiɗ, ɓa inhisoh baahiɗ na baahaaɗi, ɓa raak kos keeh-keeh. <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />Raakiɗ ɓi ɗal waaseem, ɓa muuƴca ŋ taastiɗoh ci raakɗi haf na kose. <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />Ɓa tum haf ɓa jangɗohoh ciŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> te ɓa inahɗi ali in, wa in ci ɓa na woye haa, wa in ci ɓa na ndengɗe haa.<verse eid="1TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />Ɓoo inhiɗ ne waasiŋ Musaa baahiɗ, ne findi wa na taambɗohse degu ŋ waas ɗah. <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />Inhaat inii : E yurhiɗ ci tah waasi kuruk haa waaye wa wuu tumoh moɗaaɗiici na ɓi sang taambiɗ waas, ɓi sang kerhiɗ Kooh na bakaaɗoh ci. Wa wuu ɓi bugluuɗi ŋ Kooh na ɓi eɗɗi in ciŋ Kooh cir, wa wuu ɓi na ape yaay ciŋ ɓa na baab ciŋ ɓa, wa wuu nguɗoh kiñin ci. <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />Wa wuu ɓi na faankohe faankoh sangohuuɗ, wa wuu ƴaar-ɓitiɓ ci na toontukoh <char style="w">ñaam</char> ci. Wa wuu leyoh ci na ɓi na giñe mbalay. Wa wuu ɓi na tume in ci ɗaloh na keeh ki jangɗohu.<verse eid="1TI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />Jangɗoheem hun hun na <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char> ŋ dengkohu, wi na teeɓohe yakki Kooh yi Heɗ muuɗ yak.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool corkiɗiɗ Kooh ŋ baahohi a baahoh ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />Mi yii corkiɗ Heɗ ɓoo Kiristaani Yeesu yi on ndo hatil, a oolukka so po a tufkiɗta so, ne ŋ nik ŋ pangkii. <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />Mi yi meeɗ ɗe ɓas, ŋ tolfiɗee ɓi kos ɗe, ŋ tumee ɓa in miskiɗ lool. Waaye ŋ miskiɗ Heɗ ɓoo, laam e inhaaɗi ɓekee so nga sagu kosaaɗi. <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />Heɗ ɓoo baahohiɗ to laayoh na laayoh, a onnda so kos na waaɗ Kooh na ɓooɓi, ŋ niki ŋ nik ŋ Kiristaani Yeesu.<verse eid="1TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" />Woo kii wooriɗ te wa oolkaah keeh-keeh : « Kiristaani Yeesu hayiɗ Adina ne a muciɗ bakaaɗoh ci. » Te e ñam uup nik bakaaɗoh. <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />Waaye ŋ yirmuuɗ ne Kiristaani Yeesu teeɓoh mini a min muñ jen nga so, mi yi uup nik bakaaɗoh. Te ineem misaal ne yaa nu kos ɗe ɗah, hey rahse kipes ki heyɗi reehe.<verse eid="1TI 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />Kooh yi yino-kongi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 1:17">Buuri genan gen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 1:17">yi kaananɗi po faw,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 1:17">yi has minɗi hot,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 1:17">a yi eɗaah cir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 1:17">a yi yakɗaah po faw !</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1TI 1:17" />
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 1:17">Amiin !<verse eid="1TI 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hiñohi baahiɗi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />Kon Timoote, mi yii dengkoh ɗa inii kuɓu. Wa hun na woo-woosuuɗ ci woysee nga ɗa ɗeɓgaan. Taambɗa woo ceem, fu hiñoh hiñohi baah ; <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />kaɗa nga na kos na inhisoh baahiɗ na baahaaɗi. Raakiɗ ɓi faɗ in ceem po ɓa yahrohiɗ kosiŋ ɓa findi gaal suuhiɗ. <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />Ɓooɓeem Himene na Aleksaandar ɓaah nga ; ŋ faɗiɗ ɓa na Seytaani ne ɓa jang, ɓa ɗalissuu Kooh.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Nakoh ci kaɗ ŋ findi ɓooɓi kiimohan Kooh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />Mbaa ini uup raak njiriñ, weɗ mi na hee woye paaɗ : Mi na ñaahohe ne ɓi Janguuni nik ŋ kiim Kooh, ɓa kiimee keeh-keeh wuu ɓooɓi jen, wa hun na corkiɗ Kooh. <verse eid="1TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />Ɓa kiimɗee buur ci na kilifaaciŋ kur ci jen ne ɓoo min raak kipes yeeɓkiɗ huniɗ na jam, ɓoo haɓɗee in yurhiɗ ŋ fiki Kooh, na mandohaaɗ baahiɗ keeh-keeh. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Ineem weɗ moɗ te weɗ neɓ Kooh Mucɗohiŋ ɓoo, <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" />Kooh yi waaɗ ne ɓo' ci jen muc te ɓa kaɗ po ɓa min inah keeh ki. <verse eid="1TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />Laam :</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1TI 2:5" />
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 2:5">A Kooh yino dong raak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 2:5">te harmbanɗoh yino nam raak</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 2:5">ŋ harmban Kooh na ɓo' ci.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 2:5">A <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> Yeesu, te a ɓo',<verse eid="1TI 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />yi eɗoh kiñin kiŋ ɗe haf ce</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 2:6">ne a romkoh ɓo' ci jen.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1TI 2:6" />
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 2:6">Ineem weɗ Kooh teeɓoh wi jamanooni a gapohee wa ree. <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" />Ŋ pangkiŋ Kooh weem, a tummba so yegɗohoh na <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ne ŋ jangɗee ɓi nikɗi Yawuut kosi na keeh ki. Mi na woye keeh, ŋ leyɗi.<verse eid="1TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />Mbaa ŋ waaɗ ne, ŋ ɗisik nu ɗu coh ɗah, ƴaar ci kiimee Kooh, ɓa raɗsee Kooh yaah hooliɗ, wa hunuu na ayruk na taastiɗoh.<verse eid="1TI 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ini kaɗ ŋ ɓitiɓ ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" />Ŋ namiɗ waaɗ ne ɓitiɓ ci liiɓ baahiɗ ŋ kulɓaaci ɓa na ɓekke, ɓa haɓɗukee na kulɓa yiwiɗ, eɗuuɗ cir. Ɓa haɓɗukuu haɓɗuk uupiɗ ŋ haf ciŋ ɓa, na urus ci wala per ci ɓa na tokke, na kulɓaaci na care kopor laayiɗ. <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />Waaye haɓɗukiŋ ɓa nikaat tum in baahiɗ findi ɓitɓi woo ne a nikiɗ Kooh.<verse eid="1TI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Ɓitiɓ joy joy kerhiɗ jangɗohoh ci, a jangee na yeeɓuk. <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" />Ŋ teyɗohɗi ɓitiɓ ne a jangɗohee wala a adgiɗ ƴaar ; a joy joy ɗek. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" />Laam, a Aadama ɗeɓ mahu, Aawa taammba nga. <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" />Te a Aadama ñaañohu haa, a ɓitɓa a yi ñaañohu, a kerhiɗeeɗi Kooh, a keennda ŋ bakaaɗ. <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Waaye raakiŋ ɓitiɓ ci kuɓu hondohɗi ɓa mucɗu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ŋ jamanoonaam, wa raakeen ɓi ɓitiɓ nga, ɓa nikee heɗ raak-raak, ɓa raakee hot-hot wiiriis ŋ waas-Kooh, an ɓo' joyee nik liiɓ dong, faan baahɗi. Wa kaɗta po ɓa sannga sah raak kuɓu. Raakiɗ liiɓoh ci amb ne ɓitiɓ ceem jeemeen ɓek liiɓohaaɗeem ŋ Janguuni. Wa miniɗ nik ne weɗ tah po Pool woosa ini a woo ŋ ndii.</char></note><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:15-16">Camba 3:15-16</ref></char></note> ne ɓa ris kosiɗ Kooh, ɓa waaɗ ɗe, ɓa pesee pes hooliɗ wuu ce te peseem hun na amb haf ɓa ɗah.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Findi ɓi adgohan Janguuni joy mand</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />Woo kii woo wooriɗ : Ɓo' nu na waaɗe nik yi adgohan ɓi Janguuni ɗah, a na waaɗe panguk moɗiɗ. <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" />Tahha po ɓoyi adgohan ɓooɓi, a joyɗi raak woyɗaah moɗaaɗi ; a joy top ŋ ɓitiice, a min amb haf ce, a hendɗoh pesohaaɗiŋ ɗe, a nawu. A dalɗee ɓi na haye kahan ce moɗoɗ, a min jangɗoh. <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />A joyɗi nik laaroh, wala ɓo' waaɗiɗ hiñoh, waaye a joy nik ɓo' soosiɗ, waaɗiɗ jam ; a waaɗuu kopor lool.<verse eid="1TI 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />A raak taambkoh moɗoɗ ŋ ɓi kahan ce, kuɓuuciŋ ɗe kerhiɗ ɗe, ɓa eɗ ɗe cir mitiɗ. <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />Laam ɓoyi minɗi taambkoh kahan ce moɗoɗ, minohan taambkoh Janguuniŋ Kooh na ?<verse eid="1TI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />A joyɗi nik ɓoyi na hane kos. Mbaa yaksiɗuk miniɗ ɗe amb te Kooh hey ɗe atte'e findi a atte'ohee Seytaani. <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />Te a joyiɗ nam raak seede moɗiɗ ŋ fiki ɓooɓi kosɗi ne ɓa raakuu woyɗaah ɗe, a keenuu ŋ kafind ciŋ Seytaani.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Findi ɓi taambkohan in ciŋ Janguuni joy mand</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Ɓooɓi naman kooɗu ne ɓa taambkohee in ciŋ Janguuni, ɓa nikan ɓo' eɗuuɗ cir, ɓo'-keeh, ɓa joyɗi nik ɓo' yahkiɗ ŋ sangara te ɓa joyɗi waak kopor ŋ ini lahɗi waas. <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />Ɓa joyiɗ amb keeh ki teeɓohu ŋ waasi ɓoo kos. Ɓa amba na hel daliɗ. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />Ɓa joy joy markisku paaɗ po ɓa raakɗi woyɗaah moɗaaɗi ɗah, ɓa han camb pangkeem.<verse eid="1TI 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />Ɓitiɓ ciŋ ɓa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">"ɓitiɓ ciŋ ɓa" : ini gerek woo ndii, wa namiɗ min tokis : "Ɓitiɓ ci na taambkohe in ciŋ Janguuni".</char></note> namiɗ joy eɗu cir, ɓa nikuu ɗooɓoh ɓo', ɓa min amb haf ɓa, ɓa car oolku ŋ in nu nik. <verse eid="1TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />Ɓi kooɗu ne ɓa taambkohee in ciŋ Janguuni, yaa nu nga ɓa joy top ŋ ɓitiice, a raak taambkoh baahiɗ ŋ komaakciŋ ɗe na ɓi kahan ce.<verse eid="1TI 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />Laam ɓi pangkan pangkeem baahiɗ, ɓa hey yakɗasse, te ɓa heyɗi neƴƴohe woo ɓooɓi ini kaɗ ŋ kosi ɓa kos <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> Yeesu.<verse eid="1TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ini ɗasɗukiɗi Kooh teeɓoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />Ŋ liiɓiɗ ne ŋ hey ɗa hee marke ndii na maañaaɗi waaye ŋ fiisiɗ inii <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />ne hayiŋ ngo yiih ɗah, fu inah findi ɓi kahan Kooh joy pesoh, ɓi Janguuniŋ Koohi na pese. Janguuneem, wa kumbini na inhiɗohe keeh ki, wa <char style="tl">fondamaani</char> amb keeh ki.<verse eid="1TI 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />Ali ɓo' minɗi taas ne, ini ɗasɗukiɗi ŋ kosi ɓoo kos te wa teeɓohuusa, wa in yakiɗ :</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1TI 3:16" />
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">A hayiɗ findi ɓo',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">
    <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh</char> teeɓohiɗ kiyurhiŋ ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">Malaakaaci hotiɗ ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">A yegɗohuuɗ ŋ kur ci jen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">A kosuuɗ ŋ Adina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">A rapɗuuɗ ŋ Asamaan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">A yakɗuusa.<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="s">Jangɗoh ci na muuƴɗohe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />Moona <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> woyiɗ hooliɗ ne ŋ jamanooci mirndohan, ɓi ɓo' hey faɗe kosi, ɓa taambiɗ <char style="w" lemma="jiini">jiiniici</char> na muuƴɗohe na ini jiiniiceem na jangɗohe. <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />Ɓooɓeem hey faɗe naafeehaaci leyoh ci ɓa ñaañoh ɓa. Ñaañohoh ceem, liiɓohaaciŋ ɓa ñaasuuɗ na tiwiñ dohɗuuɗ. <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />Ɓa na sangohe kilookoh, ɓa faɗɗukohee ɓooɓi ɓi kañam. Te moona a Kooh fer kañam ceem. A fer ca ne ɓi kos te ɓa inahha keeh ki njirñiɗkohee ca, corkiɗee ɗe ŋ ineem.<verse eid="1TI 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />In ci Kooh fer jen baahiɗ, ali sangaah raakɗi nga waaye ɗu njirñiɗkohee ca ɗah, corkiɗaat ɗe nga. <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />Laam in ci Kooh fer jen, ca hooliɗ, ne ca njirñiɗkohu findi a woyoha, te wa hun na kiim Kooh ɗah.<verse eid="1TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Surgaaniŋ Yeesu baahiɗi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />Fu jangiɗ ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ci in ceem ɗah, fu hey nike surga baahiɗ, yiŋ Kiristaani Yeesu. Ŋ ineem, fu na hee pesohe woo ciŋ kosi, fu na hee pesohe jangɗohi baahiɗi fu ŋoɗ nga.<verse eid="1TI 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />Kina sikɗuk andiin ci hunɗi na kosi, andiin ci mbalay ci, waaye meeɗɗa haf fu tum ini neɓ Kooh. <verse eid="1TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />Meeɗiɗ faaniŋ ɗa yoonduk, wa raakiɗ njiriñ, waaye njirñiŋ wa laayɗi. Meeɗiɗ haf fu tum ini neɓ Kooh weɗ raak njiriñ ŋ in ci jen, wa hun na gapohiŋ Kooh ŋ kipes kii na wi na haye. <verse eid="1TI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />Woo keem wooriɗ te wa oolkaah jameet.<verse eid="1TI 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" />Weɗ tah ɓoo na pangke panguk miskiɗ, ɓoo lebere. Laam ɓoo oolkiɗ Koohi na pese, a yi Mucɗohiŋ ɓooɓi jen, ŋ woyisɗi ɗa kosiɗ ci.<verse eid="1TI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Altiɗkohaah wuu kosiɗ ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />In ceem ceɗ fu joy nakoh, fu jangɗohee ca. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />Ali ɓo' kinaat ɗa heef sagu kikomaakiikiŋ ɗa ! Waaye fu, nika altiɗkohaah ŋ kosiɗ ci ŋ woo ciŋ ɗa na pesohaaɗiŋ ɗa na waaɗi fu waaɗ ɓooɓi na kosiŋ ɗa na hool kiŋ ɗa. <verse eid="1TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Ndengɗuka fu jangee ŋ fiki ɓooɓi jen teereeci hooliɗ ci ; fu paysohee ca na ɓa ne fu ñaah ɓa, fu jangɗohee ca, fu tumohaah ɗaa po ŋ hay.<verse eid="1TI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />Kina sagankoh ini Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani on ɗa, wi fu rahas taamboh ŋ woo-woosuuɗ ci woysee nga ɗa, wa yakak ci adgoh Janguuni degee ɗa yaah ciŋ ɓa. <verse eid="1TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />Faɗoha ineem nof te fu tufuk nga baahiɗ po ɓooɓi jen hot ne fu yii kaɗ fiki. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />Wortuka ŋ pesohaaɗiŋ ɗa na jangɗohiŋ ɗa. Amba nga baahiɗ. Fu tum ineem ɗah, fu hey muce, fu na ɓi na sikɗukee ɗa.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />Fu dengee yaɓko ɗah, kina woo na ɗe woo ndengiɗ, waaye woya na ɗe woo moɗoɗ po haa a yi baab ɗu. Fu dengee fiir ci po haa ɓa taambɗoh ciŋ ɗa. <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />Fu amb ɓitif ci findi yaay ciŋ ɗa, na cafaƴ ci findi taambɗoh ciŋ ɗa ɓitiɓ, wa hun na hool keeh-keeh.<verse eid="1TI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓitiɓ ci ƴaar ciŋ ɓa kaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />Ɓitiɓ ci ƴaar ciŋ ɓa kaan te ɓa raakɗi ɓi ɓaatɗohan ɓa, taambkohaa ɓa, fu eɗ ɓa cir. <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Waaye ɓa raak ɓi kuɓu wala set ɗah, ɓeem ɓeɗ joy ɓa taambkoh, ɓa inah ne ɓa joy koc pes kosiŋ ɓa ŋ kahan ɓa. Ɓa tum ineem ɗah, ɓa hey wirnde ɓi rim ɓa ini ɓeem tumiɗ ɓa. Ineem weɗ ini neɓ Kooh.<verse eid="1TI 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Ɓitɓi maa woye ndii, a ɓitɓi ƴaar ce kaan, yi nik kiik ce. A raakɗi yi ɓaatɗohan ɗe, a oolkoh Kooh dong te a kiimee ɗe noh na wek ne Kooh ɓaatɗoh ɗe. <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />Waaye yi na taambɗe ini neɓ kiñin kiŋ ɗe dong, ali nik ne a ris pes sah, a kaaniɗ.<verse eid="1TI 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />In ceem ceɗ fu joy nakoh ne ɓa woysuu ali in moɗaaɗi. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Ɓo' taambkohɗi ɓaah ciŋ ɗe, ŋ woyisɗi ɗa ɓi kahan ce ɗah, a faɗiɗ kosiŋ ɗe te a yi uup baahaaɗi kosaaɗi.<verse eid="1TI 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />Ɓitɓi ƴaar ce kaan te a joyya fiisu ne Janguuni amboh ɗe, ƴissuut po ƴissuut, a joyiɗ raak kiis ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-yino (60) te a joy nik ɓitɓi topee ŋ ƴaar ce. <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />A joyiɗ inhu ŋ in ci baahiɗ ci a tum, findi : Koɗ kuɓuuciŋ ɗe baahiɗ, na daliɗ baahiɗ ɓi na haye kahan ce, na ruhsiɗ haf ce ŋ fiki <char style="w">ɓo'-Kooh ci</char> ne a ɓaatɗoh ɓa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">"ruhsiɗ haf ce ŋ fiki ɓo'-Kooh ci ne a ɓaatɗoh ɓa" : Ŋ Fiis ci ndii, gerek woo ne : "naawsiɗ ɓo'-Kooh ci kot ciŋ ɓa". Marka teerndiŋ </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 13:4-17">Saaŋ 13:4-17</ref></char>.</note>, na ɓaatɗoh ɓi nik ŋ miskiɗ, na gen tum in baahiɗ nu wa min nikoh ɗah.<verse eid="1TI 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />Waaye kina fiis ɓi raakɗi kiis ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-yino (60), laam hel ciŋ ɓa nik ŋ raakis ƴaar ɗah, wa na ɓekee ɓa ŋ faɗ taambkoh in ciŋ <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char>. <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />Ŋ ineem, ɓooɓi raak woyɗaah ɓa ŋ ini ɓa taambiɗɗi gapohi ɓa gapee Kiristaani. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />Ɓaatta nga, ini ɓa haɓɗisɗi ali in hey tahe po ɓa genan wiltiɗoh ŋ kahan ci. Ɓa topanɗi ŋ haɓɗisaaɗi ali in, waaye ɓa hey laaye nguɓ, ɓa aasee ŋ in ci waas ɓa nikohɗi, ɓa woyee mbalay.<verse eid="1TI 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Ineem weɗ tah po ŋ waaɗ ne ɓi ƴaar ciŋ ɓa kaan te ɓa rissa komaaki, ɓa raakis ƴaar, ɓa raak ɓi kuɓu, ɓa taambkoh kahan ciŋ ɓa baahiɗ po sangiɗi raakuu woyaah. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />Raakiɗ ɓi muuƴ nga ɓa po ƴutiɗ, ɓa ɗii taambiɗ Seytaani.<verse eid="1TI 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />Ɓitiɓ kosiɗ raak ɓaah ɓitiɓ, ɓi ƴaar ciŋ ɓa kaan ɗah, a joyiɗ ɓa ɓaatɗoh. Ineem hey eɗfiɗe pangkiŋ Janguuni po wa min taambkoh baahiɗ ɓi raakɗi ɓi ɓaatɗohan ɓa.<verse eid="1TI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakak ciŋ Janguuni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />Yakak ci na tiindɗe Janguuni baahiɗ yeyyoo'iɗ eɗu cir kanak : Ɓa joyiɗ yakɗu, ɓa joyiɗ wirndu, te ɓi ndengɗuk ŋ paysohiŋ Woo ki na jangɗohiŋ wa, ɓeɗ uup yeyyoo cireem. <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" />Laam Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci woyiɗ ne : « Kina hondoh ñam inoh fi na dake ŋ mbong ci<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">inoh fi na dake ŋ mbong ci ne a yon ca </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ŋ jamanoonaam, ɓa meeɗeen ɓay ɓi inoh, ɓa wilɗee ca ŋ ɗafuk mbong ci, ca dakee ca po ca yon ca. Marka Rohƴiɗi 25:4</char></note> ne a yon ca ! » Ɓaatta nga an : « Pangkoh joyiɗ wirndu !<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:7">Luk 10:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:10">Macce 10:10</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="1TI 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" />Kina teyɗuk ne ɓo' ŋ yakak ci adgoh Janguuni yambu in, hanaa wa raak seede kanak wala kaahay ɗah. <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />Ɓi gen bakaaɗee, woytohaa ɓa ŋ fiki ɓooɓi jen, ŋ ineem ɓinooɓi neƴƴoh, tumuu findiiɓa. <verse eid="1TI 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />Ŋ fiki Kooh, ŋ fiki Kiristaani Yeesu na ŋ fiki malaakaaciŋ Kooh, mi yii nak ɗa ne fu taambiɗ nakoh ceem te wa hunuu na talsoh : Ɓooɓi hendaat hend nga ɗa.<verse eid="1TI 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />Kina teel deg yaah ciŋ ɗa ŋ ɓo' ne fu tufkiɗ ɗe findi njiit, fu kee ɓaaha na ɗe bakaaɗ ci a tuman. Fu ŋ haf fu, risa ŋ kihool kiŋ ɗa. <verse eid="1TI 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />Kina topis ŋ an masuɓ ɓarang, ambsohaa wa na biiñ ƴissuut sagu miski rookiŋ ɗa yooɓ misik.<verse eid="1TI 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />Raakiɗ ɓooɓi nga, bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓa na hotke fang, bala ɓa atte'san. Waaye ɓinooɓi, kaɗ po maañ ɗah, ciŋ ɓa han hotuk. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />Wa mand ɗaa na tumohaaɗ ci baahiɗ ci. Cum na hotke fang ; ci hotukɗi ŋ saasi sah, ca minɗi ris ɗasɗukiɗ.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="s">Kosiɗ ci nik ñaam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />Kosiɗ ci nik <char style="w">ñaam</char> jen joyiɗ amb ne heɗ ciŋ ɓa eɗaah cir keeh-keeh po tiikiŋ Kooh na ini ɓoo jangɗoh woysuu moɗaaɗi. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />Ɓi raak heɗ kosiɗ, eɗaat ɓa cir, ɓa sang ɓa heef ŋ ini ɓa nik ɓaah ciŋ ɓa kotii. Ɓa joy ɓa uup ñaamuk ŋ ini ɓa nik kosiɗ na waaɗuuɗ ciŋ Kooh ne heɗ ciŋ ɓa rahas njirñiŋ pangkiŋ ɓa.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1TI 6:2">Jangɗoh ci nikɗi keeh na alali keeh-keehi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:2">In ceem jen ceɗ fu joy jangɗoh te fu nakoh ca. <verse eid="1TI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />Wa raak ɓoyi na jangɗohe in wiiriis te a taambiɗɗi woo ci wiriɗ ciŋ Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char> na jangɗohi hun na yakiɗ Kooh ɗah, <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />ɓoyeem, a ɓo' riifiɗ na yeg haf ce. A ɓo' inhaaɗi, a raak kosaay woo, a na taastiɗohe ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ toksiŋ woo ci. Te ineem na rime siisoh na lahtoh na ɓasoh na liiɓ moɗaaɗi. <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />Wa ɓayee taasoh ci minɗi reeh ŋ harmban ɓo' ci fu inah ne liiɓohaaciŋ ɓa tiindisɗi. Ɓa hotisɗi keeh ki te ɓa liiɓ ne kos Kooh raakoha alal.<verse eid="1TI 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Wa keeh ne kos Kooh, wa raak-raak yakak, nik ne fu doyɗukiɗ ŋ ini fu raak ɗah. <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />Ɓoo hayɗi na ali in ŋ Adina te ɓoo minɗi coottoh ali in nga. <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />Kon ɓoo raak kañam na ɓekkaah na genoha ɗah, ineem joyiɗ ɓoo doy. <verse eid="1TI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />Waaye ɓi na waake raak-raak laayiɗ, ɓa na keene ŋ kafind ci na fiir ci, te waaɗ-waaɗ ciŋ ɓa naandtiɗohaaci laayiɗ ci, ca na yahrohe yahroh. Waaɗ-waaɗ ceem na ɓekee ɓooɓi ŋ sooƴ na boomu. <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Findi ɓooɓa na woyohee wa, « Waaɗ kopor weɗ na rime moɗaaɗi nu nik. » Ɓum na waakee wa waak miskiɗ, tahha po ɓa muuƴiɗ po ɓa usiɗ kos te ɓa ɓekiɗ haf ɓa tiis laayiɗ.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Leberi baahiɗi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Waaye fu, ɓoyiŋ Kooh, nupa in ceem. Gena ndengɗuk ne fu nik ɓo' yurhiɗ, fu taambɗee Kooh, wa hun na kos na waaɗoh na muñ na soos. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" />Lebera leberi baahiɗi, leberi kosiŋ ɓoo meeksoh, fu raak kipes ki heyɗi reehe, weɗ tah Kooh ɓeeɗuk ɗa. Kipes keem, weɗ fu seede seede moɗiɗ ŋ fiki mboolo laayiɗ.<verse eid="1TI 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" />Ŋ fiki Kooh, yi na eɗe in ci jen kipes na fiki Kiristaani Yeesu yi seede seedeeni moɗiɗi ŋ fiki Ponse Pilaat, mi yii nak ɗa ne : <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />Amba nakohi fu rahas te fu ris hooliɗ, fu raakuu woyɗaah moɗaaɗi, po mbaɗna Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu Kiristaa teeɓkohan ; <verse eid="1TI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" />te teeɓkoheem, a Kooh tumana ŋ jamanooni a amb.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1TI 6:15" />
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 6:15">A Kooh Heɗ Jam</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 6:15">te a yi dong Heɗ Hatil,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 6:15">Buuriŋ buur ci,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 6:15">Heɗiŋ heɗ ci.<verse eid="1TI 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />Kaanaaɗi, a yi dong raaka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 6:16">A gen ŋ ɗooƴ siñaar</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 6:16">siñaari minɗi rahsu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 6:16">Ali ɓo' hotɗi ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 6:16">ali ɓo' minɗi ɗe hot ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 6:16">cir na hatil wuu ce po faw !</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1TI 6:16" />
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 6:16">Amiin !<verse eid="1TI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">In ci heɗ raak-raak ci naku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />Naka heɗ raak-raak ciŋ adinaani woti ne ɓa yeguu haf ɓa te ɓa oolkohuu raak-raak ; raak-raak woorɗi. Ɓa oolkohaat Kooh, yi na one ɓoo on mitiɗ ne ɓoo min neɓsiɗuk nga. <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />Woyaa ɓa ne ɓa tumaat in baahiɗ, in baahiɗ laayiɗ. Ɓa minaat onoh te ɓa teyɗuk paysoh na ɓooɓi. <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />Ɓa tumoh ɗaa ɗah, ɓa hey nangɗohe raak-raak moɗiɗ wuu kim, jaar ɓa raak kipes ki keeh-keehi.<verse eid="1TI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dengkoh ci mirndoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />Kon Timoote, ɗaakkoha nof baahiɗ ini fu eɗu, fu nup woo ci naandohaaci, ci bugulɗi Kooh. Fu nup taasoh ciŋ ɓi na ndamkohe inhiŋ ɓa te wa inah haa. <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />Raakiɗ ɓi liiɓ ne ɓa inhiɗ laayiɗ ŋ ini ɓa inah weem, te ɓa muuƴ muuƴ po ɓa usiɗ kos.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Heɗ ɓoo baahohaat ɗu !<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>